# Line-ending law for this repository.
# Committed FIRST among content commits so no CRLF-poisoned blob can enter history.
# Semantics (verified against git-scm.com): `text eol=lf` normalizes to LF on check-in
# AND forces LF checkout on Windows regardless of the cloner's core.autocrlf setting.
# A bare `text` attribute would NOT — do not weaken these rules.

# Normalize everything to LF in repo AND working tree, all platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts that cmd.exe may misparse with LF (labels/goto).
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets (seed product images land in Phase 3) — never transform.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary

# Self-documenting explicit entry: Maven wrapper must stay LF everywhere.
# Redundant with the catch-all but intentional per research Pattern 4.
mvnw text eol=lf
